<title>USA: Chateau buys back 450,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Chateau buys back 450,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>CLINTON TOWNSHIP, Mich. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chateau Properties Inc said Wednesday it completed the repurchase of 450,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases were made at prices ranging from $25 to $24 5/8, the company said.</p>
<p>Chateau and ROC Communities Inc have agreed to a revised merger. Following the vote of the ROC shareholders, Chateau said it may repurchase up to an additional one million shares of its common stock in open market purchases, privately negotiated deals or a tender offer.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
